# The staged copy of the Expo web build, produced by `expo export` and copied
# in at deploy time. It is build output and does not belong in git.
#
# It must NOT be added to .gcloudignore: gcloud reads .gcloudignore INSTEAD OF
# .gitignore when one exists, so this file is invisible to the deploy and web/
# still ships. Excluding it there would deploy a service with no site.
web/
